<title>ITALY: Minimum rate 7.83 pct at Italy lira repo tender.</title>
<headline>Minimum rate 7.83 pct at Italy lira repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The minimum rate at today's 12.0 trillion lire seven-day Bank of Italy repurchase tender was 7.83 percent, compared with 7.35 percent at the previous repo tender on December 9, the Bank said.</p>
<p>The average rate was 7.90 percent against 7.45 percent at the last repurchase pact for 14.0 trillion lire and 30 days.</p>
<p>The pact takes effect today or tomorrow and the securities are for resale on December 16. The Bank said it received 42 bids of which 26 were met in full and one in part.</p>
</text>
